{"id": 989329, "slug": "ghost-of-yotei", "name": "Ghost of Yotei", "name_original": "Ghost of Yotei", "description": "<p>Taking place 300 years after the critically acclaimed Ghost of Tsushima, this standalone experience follows a haunted, lone mercenary named Atsu in the 1600s. Thirsty for revenge, she sets out to hunt down those who killed her family many years prior.</p>\n<p>Her quest across Ezo will take her to unexplored lands as she seeks out a gang of six outlaws. Along the way, she’ll encounter far more than she could have wagered for at the journey’s outset. Help her find unlikely allies, forge lasting bonds and build a path towards healing and redemption.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-10-02", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-10-12T15:21:22", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/30b/30b195c2321d763f807366967ffad793.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/bdb/bdb8c547a3e778b7bd33f00971fc945c.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 4.21, "rating_top": 5, "ratings": [{"id": 5, "title": "exceptional", "count": 30, "percent": 51.72}, {"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 22, "percent": 37.93}, {"id": 1, "title": "skip", "count": 6, "percent": 10.34}], "reactions": {"14": 1, "15": 1, "16": 1, "18": 1}, "added": 397, "added_by_status": {"yet": 62, "owned": 64, "beaten": 54, "toplay": 199, "dropped": 5, "playing": 13}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 5, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 3, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 8, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 4, "ratings_count": 54, "suggestions_count": 269, "alternative_names": ["Ghost of Yōtei"], "metacritic_url": "https://www.metacritic.com/game/ghost-of-yotei/", "parents_count": 0, "additions_count": 0, "game_series_count": 0, "user_game": null, "reviews_count": 58, "s